 363:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h **** 
 364:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****   /**
 365:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****    * @brief Macros required for SINE and COSINE Fast math approximations
